Z||000012||AusFiero||07-26-2001||06:01 PM||||Ok Thanks. I was just interested to know. Most of them are young here too and I am kinda wondering whre they are getting up to $60,000 to $70,000 in most cases here to buy these cars when most are trouble makers who don't work in any industry that would give them that type of money. Seems crime is the main source of income for them here. <P>Unfortunately over here they are starting to give most anybody with a hotted up car a bad rep. <P>Not all of course I am actually talking very locally because my hometown is a really nice place to hang out on a Sunday afternoon but it is really getting tarnished by these Sydney rice boys from one part of Sydney. But I suppose every large city has its trouble groups. Gangs sux. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
