Z||000026||AusFiero||07-27-2001||09:27 PM||||Well said shiner. That is why I was trying to point out a specific group in my area without looking racist. Some of my wife an my own personal friends are also Lebanese and Turkish, but unfortunately we seem to have these young gangs of them that have big chips on their shoulders and cause trouble. <BR>I just wish everyone could get along and have respect for each other, particularly when my country has been kind enough to take them in from their own war torn countries.  <P>We are pretty easy going in Australia, get internationally accused of racism against our aboriginals, you have to live here to see how wrong that really is. We have most every culture in the world here yet lately we also have ones that don't want to fit in but rather make trouble and make it just like their countries. Ahhh for a perfect world. I am dreaming again.||||reg||1
